 the record on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 7 grids runs from 1951 to 2025, and October to November, the driest pair, came in under 90% of normal in 36 of those 75 years. In 2025, September to October and October to November each came in at 36% of normal on the middle. So far in 2026, March to April sat at 56% of normal on the middle. All 7 grids had their driest year in 1954.</p>"}
